From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: macbox <macbox@localhost>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:07:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 28/33] interrupt moderation (off unless
 REIMS_VGPU_IRQ_MODERATE names an existing file)

A raise goes out only while none is outstanding; a read of 0x1018/0x1014 ends the
outstanding one before the bits are taken, so no bit is left without a raise. A raise
held past 2 ms goes out anyway. Experiment, not for adoption.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
